\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {2}{\ignorespaces Digital-twin end-to-end retrieval. (a) Baseline scenario: mean reads (95\% cluster-bootstrap CI) and q99 per policy; vertical lines: static plans (whose cost equals their q99). (b) Paired relative cost against round-robin with verified stopping on retrievals where both succeeded (95\% CI); negative is cheaper.}}{7}{}\protected@file@percent }
